  "releaseNotes": "## v3.18.14 (patch)\n\nChanges since v3.18.13:\n\n- test: use the MSTest sequence and emptiness assertions in the undo tests ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: keep list siblings when undoing a move, and keep the node a drop displaces [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- fix: truncate integer division and remainder in Python and JavaScript [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Filter the constructor's default initialisers with Where ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Keep Go constant-field values and apply instance-field initialisers ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
